Z||000008||86SE||06-06-2000||03:15 PM||||I had the same problem with a 4cyl, same allpies for the V6.  The starter was bad causing it to turn over slow.  Got a new starter and replaced the ECM fuse and it fired right up.  One morning it started fine, the next it wouldent start.||||reg||1
